            "review_title": "Review at Ocean Queen Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Евгения Ш\n6 contributions\n0\nBeautiful and delicious\nNov 2025 • Family\nThe restaurant is on the 28th floor, offering a beautiful view of the sea coast. Very comfortable, cozy. We've been here twice because we're near our hotel. Delicious seafood, wonderful employees\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Russian\nShow original\nWritten November 8, 2025\nSunshine63445859717\nDear Valued Guest,\nThank you for leaving a nice review of Ocean Queen Restaurant's services. Your review helps our staffs to work harder to bring the best quality of service to the guests.\nHope to have chances to serve you in your next stays with us.\nBest regards,\nRead more\nWritten December 19, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
